<title>RUSSIA: Russian Sept unemployment unchanged at 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Sept unemployment unchanged at 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia rose to 6.70 million, or 9.2 percent of the workforce, at the end of September from 6.68 million in August, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     SEPT 96     AUG 96    SEPT 95</p>
<p>    number unemployed (mln)     6.70	 6.68	 6.28</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce     9.2	  9.2	  N/A</p>
<p>    officially registered (mln) 2.50	 2.53	 2.10</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
